Stable and highly efficient perovskite solar cells: Doping hydrophobic fluoride into hole transport material PTAA
Chao Yu<sup>1</sup>, Buyue Zhang<sup>1,2</sup>, Chen Chen<sup>1</sup>, Jintao Wang<sup>1,2</sup>, Jian Zhang<sup>1</sup> (✉), Ping Chen<sup>1</sup>, Chuannan Li<sup>1</sup>, and Yu Duan<sup>1</sup> (✉)
